	('4a3f26e3-0ac5-4bb3-9045-080c10fe3e9c', 'guest_c28a6f15-d4db-4415-bbcd-9e05e649b4c4', NULL, 'The guest inquired about a tomato allergy and was informed that ingredients can be customized or omitted across the 11-dish menu, which features fresh produce and protein options like chicken, shrimp, or tofu. Regarding booking, the guest asked about bringing a friend, who can either reserve a spot to participate or contact the team to check policies for non-cooking companions.', 'active', '2026-04-06 13:43:00.557602+00', '2026-04-06 13:43:00.557602+00', 60, '2026-04-06 17:25:50.577162+00', '{"source": "front_app_guest"}'),
